tap-on Back
tap-on Experimental features
shot v1.12-experimental-off
tap-on Experimental features/On
expect-setting experimental=on
shot v1.12-experimental-on
tap-on Back
tap-on Keyboard & input
shot v1.12-keyboard-input-experimental
tap-on Layout
shot v1.12-layouts-with-experimental
esc
esc
esc
